<http://data.silknow.org/object/385ae1c6-289c-373c-b6a0-f332ba4a68d8>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Handkerchief of embroidered muslin with a scalloped edge and raised whitework. Each corner is decorated with an embroidered white cotton spray of flowers in padded satin stitch with speckling and drawn-thread work. The stems and the outlines of the flowers are in chain stitch.\n\nIn the centre of one side is a picture of cupid and two doves amongst the clouds and with the inscription 'Teresa Buger' in Gothic letters. This is worked with fine black silk."@en , "Handkerchief of embroidered muslin with cotton, Germany, 1820-1829."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/48df5eb1-729c-3b84-a8c4-9dc15f0a3761> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Handkerchief of embroidered muslin with a scalloped edge and raised whitework. Each corner is decorated with an embroidered white cotton spray of flowers in padded satin stitch with speckling and drawn-thread work. The stems and the outlines of the flowers are in chain stitch.\n\nIn the centre of one side is a picture of cupid and two doves amongst the clouds and with the inscription 'Teresa Buger' in Gothic letters. This is worked with fine black silk."@en , "Handkerchief of embroidered muslin with cotton, Germany, 1820-1829."@en ;
